{'symbol': 'HON', 'date': '2022-03-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN HARRIS SELECTS HONEYWELL FORGE SAAS SOLUTION TO HELP LOWER COSTS AND IMPROVE OCCUPANT EXPERIENCE', 'text': "THE FULL-SERVICE REAL ESTATE FIRM IMPLEMENTS HONEYWELL'S ENTERPRISE PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE TO IMPROVE BUILDING MAINTENANCE AND HELP ACHIEVE SUSTAINABILITY TARGETS. ATLANTA, MARCH 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0HONEYWELL (NASDAQ: HON) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT LINCOLN HARRIS, A FULL-SERVICE COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE FIRM IN NORTH CAROLINA, HAS IMPLEMENTED HONEYWELL FORGE ENTERPRISE PERFORMANCE MANAGEMENT SOFTWARE-AS-A-SERVICE TO DRIVE DIGITAL TRANSFORMATION."}